+    prefix they find (the pools certainly chosen and the candidates: the prefix's bucket spans 1/128 of a score) are
+    then counted from the two histograms, and when at most CAP, compacted in pool order (order keys into CV, pools
+    into CI) by a third read; the last two passes and the output read those only. A row with more (many equal
